<title>USA: Nalco says completes Albright purchase.</title>
<headline>Nalco says completes Albright purchase.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nalco Chemical Co said it completed its acquisition of Albright &amp; Wilson Plc, a U.K. water treatment services chemicals business.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
